<title>UK: M&amp;S - no plans to sell Brooks Bros, Kings.</title>
<headline>M&amp;S - no plans to sell Brooks Bros, Kings.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>British retailer Marks &amp; Spencer Plc said on Thursday there was &quot;no truth&quot; in market talk that it was poised to sell its Brooks Brothers and Kings Supermarkets operations in the U.S.</p>
<p>The retailer made the denial at its annual shareholder meeting.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
